    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287-a2">

                <pb facs="0773" n="651" xml:id="pg651"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 163.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gomes to Mr. Lewis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-02-26"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 26,
                        1889</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I acknowledge the receipt of the note dated
                    22 current, which your excellency did me the honor to address me on the case of
                    the line imposed on the captain of the <hi rendition="#italic">Carrie
                        Heckle</hi> in Lourenco Marques.</p>
                <p>I have forwarded an account of the contents of said note to the proper
                    authorities, whose report I await before replying to your excellency.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Barros Gomes.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
